{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemic Beasts: Restore Mizu, Tame Beasts, and Unleash The Power Of Alchemy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/314f81c0b8a6e8219658afc5768aa96c.avif?t=1775004102\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Zieg and Mioni in Alchemic Beasts, a thrilling monster taming adventure where they seek revenge and restoration in the paradise of Mizu. After a dangerous encounter, Zieg is revived by Mioni to tame unruly beasts, reclaim Mizu, and bring back its lost paradise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/68e41c871a28c00d42d99fe62f9be4a4.avif?t=1775004102\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.poster.avif?t=1775004102\" width=406 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.webm?t=1775004102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.mp4?t=1775004102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tactical Combat:</i></strong> Use elemental abilities to stagger enemies. Open them up for powerful attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stagger System:</i></strong> Engage in strategic battles using the Stagger System. Stagger foes to unleash devastating attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/e1d732a8db82ba105d834c7e60a70eb1.avif?t=1775004102\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.poster.avif?t=1775004102\" width=406 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.webm?t=1775004102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.mp4?t=1775004102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Capture and Evolve Beasts:</i></strong> Use alchemy to capture over 200 unique beasts. Evolve them with elemental ores and turn them into powerful allies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Forge Bonds:</i></strong> Build strong bonds with your beats to merge and evolve them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master Alchemy:</i></strong> Harvest and craft resources to create alchemic potions and food to keep your monsters strong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Restore Mizu:</i></strong> Complete missions to reclaim Mizu. Bring back inhabitants and rebuild the town.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1303850?t=1775004102","background_raw":"https://shared