rge Bonds:</i></strong> Build strong bonds with your beats to merge and evolve them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master Alchemy:</i></strong> Harvest and craft resources to create alchemic potions and food to keep your monsters strong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Restore Mizu:</i></strong> Complete missions to reclaim Mizu. Bring back inhabitants and rebuild the town.</p></li></ul>","developers":["White Guardian Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/header.jpg?t=1775004102","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1303850/713204/7d3e372ff72bb192a621d9dc4e8df72de669735a/1751218553/dash_av1.mpd?t=1718223027","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1303850/713204/7d3e372ff72bb192a621d9dc4e8df72de669735a/1751218553/dash_h264.mpd?t=1718223027","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1303850/713204/7d3e372ff72bb192a621d9dc4e8df72de669735a/1751218553/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1718223027","id":257030830,"name":"Alchemic Beasts Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257030830/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1718223027"}],"name":"Alchemic Beasts","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core, 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 8800 GT 512 MB, Radeon HD 4870 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>"},"platforms